      "song_duration_ms": 7627
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p04",
      "text": "Box one weighs eight pounds. Box two weighs eighteen. Ling writes down every weight.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_100/pages/p04.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_100/audio/pages/p04.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8202,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_100/audio/song/p04.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 9064
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p05",
      "text": "All eight boxes weigh seventy-eight pounds. Ling steps on the scale. She weighs fifty.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_100/pages/p05.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_100/audio/pages/p05.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7470,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_100/audio/song/p05.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 9247
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p06",
      "text": "Seventy-eight and fifty is a hundred and twenty-eight. That weight is fine. Ling can ride!",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_100/pages/p06.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_100/audio/pages/p06.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7575,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_100/audio/song/p06.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 10710
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p07",
      "text": "\"Now weigh me,\" says Chen. \"I weigh eighty. I have weighed eighty for eight years.\"",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_100/pages/p07.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_100/audio/pages/p07.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7079,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_100/audio/song/p07.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7810
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p08",
      "text": "The old freight scale does not care. It says Chen weighs a hundred and eighty.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_100/pages/p08.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_100/audio/pages/p08.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6399,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_100/audio/song/p08.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7392
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p09",
      "text": "\"Eighty?\" says Ling. \"With Chen, the sleigh would weigh two hundred and fifty-eight.\" Chen must walk.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_100/pages/p09.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_100/audio/pages/p09.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8515,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_100/audio/song/p09.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 10475
    },
    {
